{"id":1050104,"chapter_id":1050104,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"待风沙稍微弱了一些，你带着几个人和伊琳娜一起，准备前往普莱西所在的船只。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"远远看去，炮塔上耷拉下来一只衰老的手，腕上的金色手表在阴沉的天气下，依然闪烁着光芒。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"确实……是他。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"……你可以不用跟来的。","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"伊琳娜摇了摇头，朝你道了声谢谢，便转身朝驾驶舱走去。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我只是看他一眼……我去驾驶舱等你，局长大人。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"你目送伊琳娜走进船舱，深呼吸了一下，开始处理那具倒在炮塔上的遗体。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"options":["检查尸体"],"style":6,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104008,"trial_step":8,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"检查尸体","goto":9}]},{"step":9,"content":"尽管你的子弹没能命中，但驾驶员打得很准。从伤口流出的污秽溢在另一边脸颊，把未阖上的眼睛给染上一层颜色。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"这是……？","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"你带上手套，轻轻扒开死者的眼睛，仔细查看。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"他的眼睛，被做过手脚？","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"流向眼睛的液体走向奇怪，像是在往里渗，并且仔细看去，两个眼睛有些微妙地分别往左右看去——像是没安装好。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"你顿时背后起了一层冷汗：这不是普莱西！！","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"你强迫自己冷静下来，在脑内梳理了一遍整个事件的过程——","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"伊琳娜……是你在引导我。","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"从头到尾，引导你来到公海、与货船对决，告诉你攻击你们的就是普莱西的人……都是伊琳娜！","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"如今因为受到攻击，你们走上了一条未被记录在案的航线，如果不依靠伊琳娜，你们是绝对无法走出这里。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"你将两个人留下处理“普莱西”，阴沉着脸走进了驾驶舱。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？？","content":"局长？这么快就把他……“处理”好了？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"清脆的声音在暗处响起，随即惨淡的白光被啪的一声打开，照亮了你和她。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"怎么一副这样的表情？难不成……你在为那个人惋惜？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"放心吧，他的手上……也早就脏了，包括坎贝尔家的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"options":["你究竟想做什么？"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104024,"trial_step":24,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你究竟想做什么？","goto":25}]},{"step":25,"content":"自棋局开始，你就已经在盘算这一切了吧。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"哈哈……局长，我记得我们第一次促膝长谈的时候，就跟你说过。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"商人嘛……都是追逐最大化利益的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"在国际象棋里，有一种开局，叫做后翼弃兵。因为风险太大，很少有人愿意使用，用的人，也大多是高手或是……心高气傲的家伙。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"很明显……我，两者都是。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我把自己当做小兵，开局冲到你的面前……很开心，你没有让我被封在中路，让我顺利地走到最后……将这枚棋子，升变回了王后。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"你的棋艺很高超，但我想听的并不是这些。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"直接说吧，你的要求。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我喜欢跟聪明人谈生意。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"伊琳娜往后一倒，坐在了驾驶舱的皮椅上，忽略掉隐约飘来的火药味和腥臭味的话，确实与电视上那些进行签约的总裁无异。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"options":["这是普莱西教你的计划？"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这是普莱西教你的计划？","goto":36}]},{"step":36,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"还真是……名副其实的心狠手辣。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"呵呵……首先，我想你应该是明白当下的处境，所以才会一个人来找我。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"是，我必须承认，这个地方我需要你才能走出去。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但其实，你也可以用枷锁威胁我，让我不伤害你，将你完好地带出去。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"比起这些，我更希望知道真相。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你同样可以用枷锁……","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"我也说过的，伊琳娜，我一直坚持，枷锁并不是为了“控制”你们的自由而存在的。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"伊琳娜的手肘搭在扶手上，双手相握，死死地看着你。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"好，既然局长这么有自知之明，也这么心慈手软的话，我就不客气了。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我的诉求很简单——成为我在辛迪加的庇护。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"辛迪加的庇护……？你果然是想染指私矿！","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"看来你们已经在辛迪加有所动作了……毕绍果然是跟你有关系，对吧。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"是，毕竟这块肥肉，早就被辛迪加的人一点点瓜分开来了，坎贝尔又如何坐以待毙？那可是异方晶！","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"伊琳娜抬起一只手，仿佛在进行一场商业演说。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但是你也知道，那些黑帮，那些在辛迪加游荡的禁闭者……可都不是什么善茬。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"以及……我需要官方的名义，我可不希望，奎恩的口碑染上什么污点。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"MBCC的局长，我的朋友……你是最适合的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"我似乎没有拒绝的权利。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"哈哈，你有的，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"伊琳娜掩嘴，轻轻地笑了两声，再次抬了抬手。一片寂静中，你听到了无数声手枪上膛的声音。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但如果你选择了拒绝，我就只好为你和我，举办一场盛大的欢送仪式了。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"你和我？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"可怜的MBCC局长，带着他的禁闭者前往砂海的时候，不幸遇上砂盗的攻击，双双死于枪支炮火。","female_content":"可怜的MBCC局长，带着她的禁闭者前往砂海的时候，不幸遇上砂盗的攻击，双双死于枪支炮火。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"只不过，你是真的死了，而我……会重生在辛迪加，洗白一切，用一个新的身份来成就我的帝国。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"辛迪加的人，尤其是那些黑帮，不会盲目信任一个新来的家伙。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"只要让他们看不出我是新来的，不就行了？这是很简单的事情，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"……伊诺克，他会为你安排重生后的身份。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你是真的很聪明，局长，可是总是要比我慢一步。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"你深吸一口气，摇着头吐了出来，学着伊琳娜，对她露出了一个浅浅的笑容。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"options":["并不是的，伊琳娜·坎贝尔"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104066,"trial_step":66,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"并不是的，伊琳娜·坎贝尔","goto":67}]},{"step":67,"content":"我在查国际象棋的规则时，了解了一种下棋方式叫做……王车易位。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"虽然我确实是输了那盘棋……但眼下这一局可未必。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"你走到伊琳娜对面的座椅上，坐了下去，平视着她异色的双眼。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"哦？你的成长速度……还真是让我惊喜。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不愧是局长，战略用得非常……果断。我突然庆幸，你没有从商呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"当初检查到那批货物的时候，我们就留了个心眼。事实上，我去查询了近八年来，费沙城和狄斯城的货运清单。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"的确有好几年的单据已经无法找到了，但是从头些年的数据上，倒也能看出一些异常。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"伊琳娜微微蹙眉，眼神示意你继续讲下去，你们现在的状态，仿佛又回到了审查室。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"和大多数外邦城市一样，费沙城与狄斯城的贸易往来，大多数是以贵金属，换取日用品和可用能源。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"但是从八年前开始，送过去的日用品和能源一年一年地变少，最近又发现其实送来的贵金属，也是一部分一部分地变成了同等重量的狄斯币……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"据我所知，费沙城这段时间里，并没有出现大规模的疾病灾害，也不存在工业因素的耕地退化，会导致人口下降。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"那为什么……送过去的能源和日用品，却变少了呢？这样数量规模的狄斯现金……又是从哪里来的呢？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"伊琳娜的脸上，还是那幅气定神闲的表情，只不过，她的手掌交叉紧握起来，那和白砂一样的，用力积压肌肉和关节会泛起的白青色，布满了她的指周。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"那么我猜……费沙城或许是，通过一种不堪的方式易主了——而这个主人，就是手里掌握着巨量现金流的奎恩总裁，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你的想法……很残酷。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"是的，这让我本能地愿意相信你说的故事。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"但是好在……在高手面前，我的棋艺，还不算太差。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……哈哈……哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"你第一次看到这样失态的伊琳娜，尽管手掌遮住了她半边姣好的面孔，但笑声过去之后，那双眼睛里传来的，是明显的危险信号。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你说得没错，局长大人。费沙城，确实以一种残忍的方式易主了。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我觉醒成了禁闭者，普莱西本来确实是想控制我，为他的反扑大计所用。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但你说的没错，普通人如何制服得了禁闭者？况且……普莱西不正是视亲缘关系如粪土的人吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"亦或者说……我们之间的情分，在那场砂海的爆炸中，就已经消失殆尽了。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"伊琳娜仰起头，声音喑哑，她看了看船舱内，那枚投影在控制台上空的标志——那是坎贝尔家族的家徽。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"也许更早？在我母亲伴随着不上台面的身份去世，他却来找我下棋的时候——那场我唯一赢了棋的时候。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"可我并不愿意变成下一个普莱西。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"投影的画面，突然从家徽变成了一个类似监控室的画面，画面中，一位金发老人坐在轮椅上，一脸痴呆地看着面前的空棋盘。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"是普莱西？！","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"没错，我可舍不得就这样杀掉我亲爱的父亲……他还得见证我如何成为坎贝尔的骄傲。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"你对他做了什么……？！","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他年纪大了，惜命得很……几乎没有想过每天的“药片”是不是真的能让他长命百岁。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但那又如何呢？局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"伊琳娜的音调又恢复了原来的清冷，向你发问。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你该不会认为，掌握到这些信息，就能扳倒我吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"那当然不能，我是知道的。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"只不过这能让我有一个，比较公平的，评估我们之间交易的状态。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"怎样的状态？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"你坐直了身子，朝前倾去，缩短了你和伊琳娜之间的距离。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"基于以上猜想，在邀请你一起来费沙城的同时……我也向第九机关申请了武装保护。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"早在我们上船之前，一队武装成员就已经被安排在砂航船的各个角落里了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"不然我怎么敢孤身一人就和你见面呢？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"你看到伊琳娜的眉头皱了起来——显然，她没想到你在砂航船上藏着帮手。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"哈……说好这次的主要目的不是武力冲突呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"那是针对普莱西·坎贝尔而言。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但这毫无意义，局长。没有我，你们走不出这片沙漠。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"你借口帮忙躲避货船的攻击，破坏掉了砂航船的通讯和定位功能，但你应该想不到，每一个第九机关的成员，身上都有定位系统吧。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"我只要能活到他们赶到这里，就行了——请不要小看第九机关的实力。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"伊琳娜的手放了下来，脸上的笑容愈发深沉，看着你，仿佛看着一颗珍贵的宝石一般。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我很佩服你，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"是我……小看你了。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"options":["谢谢夸奖"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104118,"trial_step":118,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"谢谢夸奖","goto":119}]},{"step":119,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但是很可惜……","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"伊琳娜站起身来，走到你背后，她的手放在你的座椅的扶手上，几乎把你整个人都圈在了自己的荫蔽下。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我，伊琳娜·坎贝尔，是坎贝尔家族的人，是这八年坎贝尔的家主。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我几乎从小就看着砂航船在沙漠中沉浮穿梭。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"一艘砂航船上究竟载着多重的货物，多少人……我只要通过运行速度和吃水深浅以及扬起的沙尘面积，就能知道得一清二楚。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"伊琳娜的声音就在耳边响起，像是在跟你说悄悄话，温热气息喷洒在你的耳畔，却让你的背脊冰冷一片。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不过，我真的很欣赏你。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"从你明明连西洋棋的规则都没记清，却敢接下我的邀请开始……","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"或许……你会是一个很不错的对手。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"你想怎么样？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"content":"伊琳娜重新落座回你对面的椅子，饶有趣味地对你伸出手。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你知道了我的计划，我也明白你的想法。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"如今我们可以说是……力量对等。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那既然如此……我想和你再下一盘棋。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"什么样的“棋”？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"炮弹震碎的缺口处洒几缕阳光，间碎了你与伊琳娜中间的阴影，在茶几上形成了一副棋盘。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我会跟你回MBCC，按照你的要求进行收容——我知道根据规定，他们不会让我就此放手奎恩，因此，我还是有自由行动的时间和权利。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"怎么样，要接受我的挑战吗？米诺斯危机管理局的局长，不愿意使用枷锁控制我的局长……足以……成为我对手的局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"options":["我接受你的挑战"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104137,"trial_step":137,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我接受你的挑战","goto":138}]},{"step":138,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那么……我很期待，这场棋逢敌手的对弈，究竟会是谁赢。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"content":"既然规则已经在西洋棋局之外，那么我想，结局也不一定会是输或赢。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"你握住伊琳娜伸出来的手，她的手心微热，握住后将你往身前拉去——","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"很好……就让我们拭目以待。","voice":["vo_trial_50104_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150104141,"trial_step":141}]}